   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lucky To Be Alive**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Running Up That Hill (A Deal With God)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Feelin' Alright?**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-06-17.2** (recommended): soundboard; 22 songs; 158 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2023-06-17.Bonnaroo**: source not stated; 16 songs; 117 min [2]\n- **mmj2023-06-17**: source not stated; 16 songs; 117 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Jim [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-06-17.2**: source: SBD [1]",
